1️⃣ Reverse Linked List — LeetCode #206 ⭐
class Solution {
    public ListNode reverseList(ListNode head) {

        ListNode prev = null;
        ListNode current = head;

        while (current != null) {

            ListNode next = current.next;

            current.next = prev;

            prev = current;
            current = next;
        }

        return prev;
    }
}
🧠 Pattern
prev ← current ← next

Example:

1 → 2 → 3 → null

3 → 2 → 1 → null

Time: O(n)
Space: O(1) ✅

2️⃣ Middle of the Linked List — LeetCode #876
class Solution {
    public ListNode middleNode(ListNode head) {

        ListNode slow = head;
        ListNode fast = head;

        while (fast != null && fast.next != null) {

            slow = slow.next;
            fast = fast.next.next;
        }

        return slow;
    }
}
🧠 Two Pointer
slow → 1 step
fast → 2 steps

Fast end reach aagumbothu, slow middle-la irukkum.

Time: O(n)
Space: O(1)

3️⃣ Linked List Cycle — LeetCode #141 ⭐⭐⭐
public class Solution {
    public boolean hasCycle(ListNode head) {

        ListNode slow = head;
        ListNode fast = head;

        while (fast != null && fast.next != null) {

            slow = slow.next;
            fast = fast.next.next;

            if (slow == fast) {
                return true;
            }
        }

        return false;
    }
}
